name: sim.readCustomBufferData
description: Deprecated. See properties instead
luaSynopsis: bytes customData = sim.readCustomBufferData(int objectHandle, string tagName)
pythonSynopsis: buffer customData = sim.readCustomBufferData(int objectHandle, string tagName)
inputs:
1. objectHandle: handle of the object, sim.handle_scene, sim.handle_app or sim.handle_appstorage
2. tagName: string that identifies the data
outputs:
1. customData: the custom data
replacedBy:
- name: getBufferProperty, class: object, object_getBufferProperty.method, note: "use a 'customData.'-prefix for the property name"
